      },
      {
        "text": "If Congress continues its present course, the Social Security Trust Fund will effectively reset to zero by 2033–2034.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Under current conditions, the system will only pay out incoming payroll taxes after the trust fund is depleted.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Any solution must include both benefit reductions and changes to payroll taxes.",
