    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "You're listening to Face in the Future. I'm your host Bob Bixby, Concord Coalition Policy Director, Tory Gorman. Chief economist Steve Robinson and I are discussing Social Security Reform with former congressmen. Read Rebel of Wisconsin. We'll be right back after these short messages. Welcome back to Facing the Future. I'm your host Bob Bixby, Troy Gorman, Steve Robinson, and I are talking with former Congressman Reed Rivel of Wisconsin, and we're discussing his Social Security Reform Plan that he introduced on a bipartisan basis back in 2016. You know, we were talking a little bit about the process. Well, let me go to Steve Robinson for a question here.",
