    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/5/65119.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 32,
    "turn_text": "Correct. It won't get you there. And that means you're going to have to raise more revenue. But one of the fixes that I would put into a new bill is elements of immigration reform so you can increase the number of workers that are paying into that payroll system. because we've got this entire underground economy of undocumented workers, you know, 15, 17, 18 million that are living in a cash system. And they're not paying up to income taxes, not paying Social Security taxes. And they're not really investing too much here. They're sipping it all to wherever. And we need to pull those people out of the shadows and get them into the system. Sorry.",
