      },
      {
        "text": "Taxing the wealthy alone cannot resolve the funding shortfall.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Over-taxation risks depleting future revenue potential.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The government has invested the funds into bonds that generate interest.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "There are insufficient numbers of wealthy individuals to address the financial issue.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The interest generated from these investments flows back into the program.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The program was intentionally structured to include both wealthy and low-income participants.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Investing the funds in bonds is preferable to storing them without earning interest.",
