  {
    "episode_id": 65119,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/5/65119.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, so we're having an election in the fall, so we'll have a brand new Congress in January. So one of the things that they do at the beginning of the Congress, they'll have member briefings and sort of getting new members up to speed. So if you were to be invited to brief the new members, what advice could you give them with respect to how to put together a bipartisan effort to reform Social Security?",
