      },
      {
        "text": "Effective briefing by experienced individuals enhances legislative readiness and performance.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker possesses relevant expertise or credibility to offer meaningful advice on Social Security reform.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience (new members) values practical guidance on building cross-party collaboration.",
